# Flags for ninfer-serve.exe, which the NInfer Windows service starts on
# models\bonsai2-27b-heretic.ninfer. One option per line: the flag, then its value.
# Restart the service after an edit: sc.exe stop NInfer, then sc.exe start NInfer.
# Upgrades and uninstalls keep this file. The log is logs\ninfer-serve.log beside it.
#
# These are the flags the RTX 4090 server on fedora-108f7b runs: DFlash2 with five drafts,
# vision, and the 262144-token context with the rk8v4 KV cache.
# To listen on the network, set --host 0.0.0.0 and add --api-key <key>.
# To choose another GPU, add --device <index>.
--host 127.0.0.1
--port 8080
--model-id bonsai2-27b-heretic
--max-context 262144
--kv-dtype rk8v4
--spec dflash2
--draft-tokens 5
--vision
